WEBVTT

00:23:58.996 --> 00:24:03.413
an outside perspective on bold ideas,
looking for reasons to pull the plug,

00:24:04.163 --> 00:24:09.079
even if the project in question was their
own. So Cathy would always ask,

00:24:09.579 --> 00:24:11.996
what is the thing that will bring it down

00:24:12.454 --> 00:24:16.163
back in 2013? Cathy learned about
an idea that could disrupt

00:24:16.163 --> 00:24:19.371
the oil industry. She'd been looking
for a climate project,

00:24:19.663 --> 00:24:21.996
so she got excited about this
new study she read.

00:24:22.454 --> 00:24:26.663
What if we could further this research,
figure out how to commercialize it,

00:24:27.121 --> 00:24:32.913
and then combine that carbon dioxide with
renewable hydrogen to make hydrocarbons,